    Shift (or press T to toggle)\n\u2022 Move Hand: Space + Mouse / W,A,S,D,Q,E\n\u2022
    Rotate Hand: Hold Left Ctrl + move mouse\n\u2022 Grab / Release Cube: Press G
    (Grip)\n\u2022 UI Click / Trigger: Left Mouse Button\n\u2022 Reset Device Position:
    Press V\n\n\u25B6 Arrange cubes 1..5 in order into Slots 1..5 to win!\n\u25B6
    Dropping outside slots safely returns cube to rack."
